     "titulo": "Dialogue: preparing a cultural presentation",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "介绍「艺术与电影」时，怎样帮助观众了解它的背景？",
       "alumno": "When presenting «art and film», how would you help the audience understand its background?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "我把这个问题分成了几个方面，也整理了各自的原因。",
       "alumno": "I have divided the problem into several aspects and organised the causes of each.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "你觉得哪个方面更重要？",
       "alumno": "Which aspect do you think is more important?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "其实，我们应该先比较这两个方面，再选择解决办法。",
       "alumno": "Actually, we should first compare these two aspects before choosing a solution.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "你会根据什么标准来比较？",
       "alumno": "What criteria would you use to compare them?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "先看实际效果，再考虑成本和可能的影响。",
       "alumno": "I would look first at the actual results, then consider the cost and the possible impact.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
